      "description": "只表达本轮改变公司、报表或记录选择的增量，每项evidence来自本轮。已生效的历史操作保存在当前预览，不在此重复；仅准备当前已选记录时为空，不能重放历史排除或把已选对象描述转换成KEEP_ONLY、恢复操作。"
    },
    "restrictions": {
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 7,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "forbiddenAction": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "PREVIEW",
              "PREPARE_DISPATCH",
              "CANCEL_PLAN",
              "SHOW_RESULT",
              "EXPLAIN_RULES",
              "HELP",
              "EXECUTE_DISPATCH"
            ],
            "description": "仅表示本轮被禁止的动作。EXECUTE_DISPATCH只在禁止集合中表达不提交/不执行，不是可执行action；它不禁止PREPARE_DISPATCH。禁止准备清单才用PREPARE_DISPATCH。"
          },
          "scope": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "THIS_TURN"
            ]
          },
          "evidence": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 1000
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "forbiddenAction",
          "scope",
          "evidence"
        ]
      },
      "description": "本轮明确禁止的动作集合，不是允许列表。先准备但不提交：action为PREPARE_DISPATCH，禁止EXECUTE_DISPATCH。只预览不能禁止PREVIEW。真正提交只能由用户页面确认，本对象永远不能授权执行。"
    },
    "clarify": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
